409
00:34:00.204 --> 00:34:03.291
Walang ganyanan
bilang isang aksidente na nagkataon lamang.

410
00:34:04.083 --> 00:34:06.461
Kung alam nila
bakit sila naaksidente,

411
00:34:06.544 --> 00:34:09.130
